    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«ものの» means \"although\" or \"even though\" and presents an expectation that isn't fully met.",
     "texto": [
      "It usually appears in written texts. The first part admits a fact; the second shows a limitation or contrast.",
      "あたらしい きかい を かった ものの、 まだ つかいかた が わかりません。 (Although I bought a new machine, I still don't know how to use it.)",
      "ちず を よんだ ものの、 みち が わかりませんでした。 (Although I read the map, I didn't find the way.)"
     ],
